cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this verification package, please cite this archive and the original Gillot–Langevin–Polujan theorem."
title: "A replacement normality check for eight-variable bent functions"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "A replacement exact verification of the final enumeration in the published Gillot–Langevin–Polujan normality theorem. The proof retains their upstream cover of seven-variable abnormal quartics and does not claim a new theorem or independent classification. The archive contains code, EA-lift certificates and four-flat certificates for all 37,132 affine alignments."
